# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Bulk / derived data — reproducible via the pipeline scripts, not committed
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.json

# Scraped source data
scraped_texts/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store

# Microsoft Office lock / temp files
~$*

# Transient run logs (figures/_run.log, figures/_simr.log, etc.)
*.log

# REDCap dropdown choices export (provider data). Globbed, not an exact name: the builder
# writes redcap_physician_name_choices<SUFFIX>.txt, so --suffix runs produced files that
# this rule did not cover and that git would happily have taken.
redcap_physician_name_choices*.txt

# Configuration that must be versioned despite the blanket *.csv rule
!analysis_manifest.csv
!power_analysis_new_results.csv

# Fielded REDCap artifacts. Versioned deliberately, despite the blanket *.csv / *.xlsx rules
# and despite carrying provider data, because this repository is private and single-owner and
# because the alternative -- these files living only in a Downloads folder -- is what produced
# two near-misses: an obsolete calling sheet nearly emailed to the caller, and a slot crosswalk
# that cannot be regenerated if lost. See docs/APPENDIX_RECORD_BLINDING.md.
#
# Two of these carry the ownership label and must never leave the study team. If a caller is
# ever granted access to this repository, move them out first.
!redcap/
!redcap/**

# Local virtualenv
.venv/

# Local R package library (created by ad hoc install.packages() during this session)
.Rlib/
